      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EARN TO BURN (5) stakes winning sprinter who comes down from Queensland with a tidy record. Makes plenty of appeal first up with the two slick trials and can sit just off the speed and stamp his authority. SCAMPI (4) saves his best for this trip and his chances are greatly enhanced if the rain arrives. Unwanted in betting first up when he savaged the line late to run fourth over 1100m at Randwick. Leading player. SMASHING TIME (6) trained locally and resumes after making good progress last time in. Will run them along at a fast clip and the two good trials suggest he's ready to go. Top three contender. CATCH THE GLORY (1) resumes. Won this race last year with the 54kg on a heavy track. Raced without luck in Group company last prep and has an imposing first up record. Keep safe. THE BLACK CLOUD (2) ran second here last year and look for him late.",
